  "statuteText": "632-A:5 Spouse as Victim; Evidence of Husband and Wife. –\n\nAn actor commits a crime under this chapter even though the victim is the actor's legal spouse. Laws attaching a privilege against the disclosure of communications between husband and wife are inapplicable to proceedings under this chapter."
